OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FRob Kenney is now Youtube's master
OL,7,     Fof 'dadvice'. But his own dad
OL,8,     Fwasn't there when Rob needed him
OL,9,     Fmost and what happened between
OL,10,     Fthem is something Rob struggled
OL,11,     Fwith for years.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1935, tens of thousands who had
OL,14,     Ffollowed Mao Zedong on the Long
OL,15,     FMarch across China struggled to
OL,16,     Fsurvive. They were fleeing Chiang
OL,17,     FKai-shek's Nationalist forces.
